# <type>(<scope>): <imperative summary — max ~72 chars>
#
# Types: feat | fix | docs | refactor | test | chore
# Scopes: backend | frontend | docs  (omit for repo-wide chore)
#
# Examples:
#   feat(backend): add manual escalate endpoint
#   fix(frontend): prevent double navigation to conversation detail
#   docs: align API README with 422 error shape
#   refactor(backend): centralize domain error HTTP mapping
#   chore: ignore local SQLite database files
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY if not obvious from the diff.
# Separate backend / frontend / docs when possible.
